		{
			"name": "render_html",
			"label": "HTML View",
			"description": "Render model-written HTML as a live, interactive view inline in the conversation, inside an isolated sandbox. Use it for custom layout, animation, or a small tool (calculator, simulator, game) that render_ui cannot express.\n\nEnvironment:\n- Inline <style> and <script> run. External scripts, styles, fonts, images and media load over https. fetch/XHR/WebSocket and form submission are blocked; keep data inline.\n- Oryn styling is built in: plain inputs, select, button, table, details, progress and code already look right in light and dark. Write semantic markup; your own CSS still overrides.\n- CSS variables: --bg, --fg, --muted, --border, --surface, --accent, --success, --warning, --error, chart series --c1..--c6, --font, --mono, --radius. Helper classes: ov-card, ov-stat (+ ov-stat-label, ov-stat-value), ov-grid, ov-row, ov-stack, ov-label, ov-btn, ov-btn-primary, ov-chip (aria-pressed), ov-badge, ov-muted. window.oryn.palette holds the chart colours.\n- libs (offline, prefer them over CDN links): \"tailwind\" gives Tailwind CSS v4 utilities themed to Oryn (bg-surface, bg-accent, text-fg, text-muted, border-border...); \"chartjs\" gives a themed global Chart.\n- To send something back, call window.oryn.sendPrompt(text) from a user action; only the first call per view is delivered. By default it arrives as the user's next message: end your turn and wait. With await: true this call waits up to 10 minutes and returns it as its result.",
			"parameters": {
				"type": "object",
				"properties": {
					"title": {
						"type": "string",
						"maxLength": 200,
						"description": "Shown above the view."
					},
					"html": {
						"type": "string",
						"minLength": 1,
						"maxLength": 200000,
						"description": "A complete HTML document or a body fragment. Inline <style> and <script> are allowed."
					},
					"libs": {
						"type": "array",
						"items": {
							"enum": [
								"tailwind",
								"chartjs"
							]
						},
						"maxItems": 2,
						"description": "Built-in libraries, injected offline. Request only what the page uses."
					},
					"height": {
						"type": "number",
						"minimum": 120,
						"maximum": 1600,
						"description": "Fixed height in pixels. Omit to follow the content."
					},
					"await": {
						"type": "boolean",
						"description": "Wait for the user's input and return it as this call's result. Default false: input arrives as the user's next message."
					}
				},
				"required": [
					"html"
				],
				"additionalProperties": false
			}
		}
	]
